"Semmel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKSMLEVv7kQQDejHDXhzKdMGmtL.jpg"},{"id":27500,"name":"Marylu Poolman","role":"Theresa Brull"},{"id":1559107,"name":"Wolfgang Rüter","role":"Passenger"},{"id":50958,"name":"Sybille J. Schedwill","role":"Anna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vGlAYdSicQCMUj31xzRArpE32cT.jpg"},{"id":1962878,"name":"Anna Schütz","role":"Julia"},{"id":1297024,"name":"Guido Renner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wCJgAZjLgmqnTh3pVpIyu9Xpwl2.jpg"},{"id":1610654,"name":"Mareile Blendl","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/om2ZMx7cdNdsU1ZOSp9qLixxXfy.jpg"},{"id":1844229,"name":"Thomas Krutmann","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4sch1eqt1YT4PipWy0GmvvpqUhR.jpg"},{"id":1689735,"name":"Rouven Israel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jg1nAc8HhkWZoFQPigWQqtpRTyt.jpg"},{"id":3098013,"name":"Ileana Florentina Tautu","role":"Rita"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Io rimango qui","overview":"Basato su una storia vera, Io rimango qui appartiene al filone sick romance ma ha uno svolgimento diverso dal solito, perché la componente romantica non è necessariamente quella principale. Lungo la via infatti Steffi farà altri incontri illuminanti e verrà inseguita dai genitori, padre pastore protestante e madre veterinaria, che non sanno come affrontare la malattia della ragazza."},{"language":"en-US","title":"God, You’re Such a Prick","overview":"16-year old Steffi just graduated from high school and is very much looking forward to her class trip to Paris where she has promised her boyfriend Fabian the romantic night that she has kept him waiting for so long. Her lifelong plan to join the police forces is already set up, her adult life is right around the corner. At a routine health check-up, just before the trip to Paris, Steffi and her parents are faced with a shattering diagnosis ..."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Steffis Leben könnte nicht schöner sein: Sie ist jung, hat einen tollen Freund, den Schulabschluss in der Tasche und eine Ausbildungsstelle in Aussicht. Die Abschlussfahrt soll nach Paris gehen. Doch dann erhält die 16-Jährige unerwartet eine niederschmetternde Diagnose: Ihr bleibt nicht mehr viel Zeit zum Leben. Der Bus nach Paris fährt ohne sie… Genau jetzt tritt Zirkusartist Steve in Steffis Leben. Er hat einen Führerschein und bietet an, sie kurzerhand nach Paris zu fahren. Mit geklautem Auto, ohne Geld und verfolgt von den besorgten Eltern brechen die beiden zu einem einzigartigen Roadtrip auf. Im Nordseewind fliegen, auf Kühen reiten, oder Snowboardfahren im Hochsommer – angetrieben von unbändiger Lebenslust stürzt sich Steffi in ein unglaubliches Abenteuer."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nSABfeAPu3LNvocEUTfteShvMaP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJS6wN2RKgkYSSh0vv1al0EBfce.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":717637,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nSABfeAPu3LNvocEUTfteShvMaP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nSABfeAPu3LNvocEUTfteShvMaP.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nSABfeAPu3LNvocEUTfteShvMaP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nSABfeAPu3LNvocEUTfteShvMaP.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nAN0VystCSvKGt2Xl3eo1AYjkaC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nAN0VystCSvKGt2Xl3eo1AYjkaC.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t